  <div class="page">
    <section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <header class="section-head"><p class="section-label">01 — ABOUT</p><h2 id="about-title">Here, with faith.</h2></header>
      <div class="about-layout">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p class="lead">aQui con fe is a place for thinking, making, remembering, questioning, creating, and being present.</p>
          <p><strong>aQui</strong> means “here.” <strong>Con fe</strong> means “with faith.”</p>
          <p>Together, aQui con fe names a commitment to being present — with curiosity, with memory, with one another, and with the questions that shape our lives.</p>
          <p>This space is rooted in scholarship and creative practice, while making room for faith in its many traditions and expressions.</p>
          <p>It is also a space for the social arts: the stories, photographs, songs, poems, histories, archives, essays, performances, conversations, and everyday forms of knowledge through which communities understand themselves.</p>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="pullquote">“Ideas do not have to choose between intellect and spirit, history and art, research and story.”</blockquote>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <article class="pillar"><span class="roman">I</span><h3>Scholarship</h3><p>Research, essays, literature, history, education, law, culture, archives, and community knowledge.</p></article>
        <article class="pillar"><span class="roman">II</span><h3>Faith</h3><p>Reflections on belief, belonging, spiritual practice, justice, questions, and faith across traditions.</p></article>
        <article class="pillar"><span class="roman">III</span><h3>Arts</h3><p>Music, literature, poetry, photography, film, visual art, performance, and storytelling.</p></article>
        <article class="pillar"><span class="roman">IV</span><h3>Community</h3><p>Presence over status. Stories, resources, conversations, collaborations, and shared knowledge.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="rooms-section" id="rooms" aria-labelledby="rooms-title">
    <div class="page section">
      <header class="section-head"><p class="section-label">THE THREE ROOMS</p><h2 id="rooms-title">Three ways into the same living archive.</h2></header>
      <div class="rooms">
        <article class="room">
          <button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="room-omg"><span class="room-index">01 /</span><span class="room-title">OMG! moments <span class="expansion">ORIGINAL FAITH-BASED COMEDY · TRAGEDY · STORYTELLING</span></span><span class="room-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="room-detail" id="room-omg"><div class="room-detail-inner"><p>The holy and the hilarious sit at the same table here. Original stories move between comedy, tragedy, testimony, and the moments that make you say: <em>oh my God.</em></p></div></div>
        </article>
